WEBVTT

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:47.020
The latest personal rocket winch!

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:50.120
The latest miniature, lightweight cooler!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:55.030
A brand new Type Zero Helmet and
high-composite carbon sunshade!

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:57.160
With aramid cover!

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.060
Reinforced aramid cape!

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:02.650
Aramid knickerbockers! Aramid leggings!

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:06.170
My Winchester, back from the shop!

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:10.730
Tube magazine extension, allowing
for one extra shot per load!

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.020
The Sunabouzu...

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.840
<i>"Back in Action!"</i>

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:17.190
... is back! With brand-new equipment!

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:19.860
<i>"Brand New!!"</i>

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:25.600
And! And! And! And!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:29.710
Tadah! An M40A1 sniper rifle!

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:33.110
Atkinson stainless steel heavy barrel!

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:35.850
Unertl 10x scope sight!

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:40.480
Remington trigger set with a
trigger pull of 1-8 kilograms!

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.890
So beautiful!

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:49.850
At last you're mine, my darling M40A1-chan!

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:57.200
I'm finally in the black
after that job the other day!

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:02.980
Though I do regret letting the
treasure and boobs get away...

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:09.940
But I did get this
equally-as-delightful M40 instead!

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.050
Now, then!

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:14.070
What should I shoot first?

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:28.790
Damn!

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:02.660
Who the hell?!

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:28.800
Distance of about 1800. This guy's good...

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:32.060
Guess we know who this
baby's first target is!

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:42.840
Where is he?

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:43.700
Huh?!

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:56.950
<i>I bet you think you're lucky, Sunabouzu...</i>

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:57.950
What?!

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:03.060
<i>But I aimed the first for your
helmet, the second for your rifle.</i>

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:07.660
<i>An M40 is better prey
than a runt like you...</i>

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:08.990
Who the hell are you?!

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:15.140
<i>I wanted to see how good the guy
who beat the invincible Kong</i>

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:18.460
<i>to become the greatest handyman
in the desert really is...</i>

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:23.010
<i>I am Onuma Jiro, also known
as the Shimmering Sniper.</i>

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:25.620
<i>I challenge you, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:28.610
Who the hell do you think you are?! Huh?!

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:32.110
Hey! Say something!

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:40.660
This sucks...

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:46.160
I had finally gotten it,
after all I went through!

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:51.040
Trying to make a name, huh?! Hilarious.

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:53.640
You're challenging me, when you know

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:57.240
I'm the most skilled and
talented in all the Kanto?!

00:06:57.240 --> 00:07:00.280
Alright! You're on!

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:06.780
Wherever you hide, I will find you
and slowly torture you to death!

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:23.410
The first was there...

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:25.270
The second was here...

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:51.560
Still new...

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:10.050
Hey, what about our fight?
The guy just took off...

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:21.460
Northeast...

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:33.370
Over there, huh?!

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:52.110
Huh?!

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:56.700
He was walking down there,
so how'd he beat me here?

00:08:56.700 --> 00:09:00.440
And the speed of those shots...
Definitely an automatic.

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:02.510
This is looking bad...

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:04.810
If I can just pinpoint his location...

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.900
Come on, take the bait!

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:37.340
I just need to know where he is...

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:43.460
There! Found ya!

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:46.150
If only my M40 weren't busted...

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:52.150
Just means I'll have to get closer.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:08.490
<i>He fell...</i>

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:13.740
<i>But he's the Ghost of the Desert.
I doubt he'd die so easily...</i>

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:20.910
<i>Now for night to fall...</i>

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:45.540
Ow! Ouch!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:56.720
It's all right...

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:01.490
He's a bargain basement sniper.

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:04.470
I can't imagine he has
very fancy equipment...

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:08.500
So his scouting capabilities
are the same as mine.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.370
I figured the first to find
the other would win,

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:14.390
but how is he able to move that fast?!

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:48.770
Freeze!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:52.760
Eh?

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:54.580
Eh?

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.490
Eh?!

00:11:56.490 --> 00:11:58.780
A girl?!

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:03.350
A kid?!

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:12.520
No way!

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:37.010
<i>Thank you so much! I've been
wandering around lost for two days!</i>

00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:43.760
<i>And thanks for this delicious food!</i>

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:46.250
Oh, those are 1000 yen apiece...

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:53.030
Water's... On the house.

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:07.670
<i>No, no. If money can ensure
my life, I'll easily pay up!</i>

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:12.180
- Thanks!

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:12.180
<i>- Here you are.</i>

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:16.330
<i>Boy, am I glad I met someone nice!</i>

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:19.950
<i>Not like that creep I met earlier!</i>

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:23.800
<i>He wouldn't even glance at me
when I was on my last legs,</i>

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:26.820
<i>and he held a rifle this
long like he was so great...</i>

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.730
What?! Say that again!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.770
You met him?!

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:45.150
Where?! Where was he?!

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:51.620
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.540
Hey!

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.940
Kid! Hide unless you wanna die!

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:08.690
<i>It's okay! I know I won't get shot!</i>

00:14:08.690 --> 00:14:09.610
Huh?!

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:11.550
<i>Upsy-daisy...</i>

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:14.070
Hey, wait, that's mine!

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:17.210
<i>Well, goodbye!</i>

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.720
Hey, you!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:30.770
Aha! Those footsteps!

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:35.900
That brat! She was playing
Onuma Jiro's double!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:45.460
Crap.

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:10.350
So hot...

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:15.540
She took off with all my
water and spare batteries...

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:20.320
I need to save it for emergencies,
but wearing my helmet

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:25.620
with the cooler off to
scan for them is hell...

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:31.200
<i>He hasn't moved one bit, Master.</i>

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:37.060
<i>Nope. But good job stealing his bag, Taiko.</i>

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:41.800
<i>Now we just wait.</i>

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:46.760
<i>Kill the Sunabouzu, and you'll be
famous and gets lots of hit jobs!</i>

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:51.620
<i>He's only famous because of his craftiness.</i>

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:56.220
<i>It's only natural for me to bring him down.</i>

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.710
<i>He is the exact opposite of you.</i>

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:03.390
<i>You're a top-skilled sharpshooter,</i>

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:07.260
<i>though your drawback is that you're
too nice and bad at business.</i>

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.490
<i>Don't be so frank.</i>

00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:16.770
<i>Wow!</i>

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:21.080
<i>There sure is a lot in here...</i>

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:24.310
<i>Don't be touching anything.
It could be dangerous.</i>

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:25.300
<i>Yes, sir...</i>

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:29.510
<i>"Danger"</i>

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:28.650
<i>What's this?</i>

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:34.040
If I at least knew where they were...

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:44.190
Not this...

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:48.230
I hoped I'd never have to use this, but...

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:10.620
<i>Your move, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:37.380
<i>Master!</i>

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:41.920
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:43.320
Time to go boom!

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:47.050
Up there!

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:16.110
<i>Master...</i>

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:18.190
<i>Taiko! Are you alright?!</i>

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:19.720
<i>Y-yes...</i>

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:27.430
<i>What is it?!</i>

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:43.390
<i>Tons of Sunabouzus!</i>

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:45.250
<i>What is this?!</i>

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:46.380
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:51.310
<i>- What the?!
- A balloon!</i>

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:54.820
<i>Are these...  All balloons?</i>

00:18:55.960 --> 00:19:00.370
<i>No, he's definitely hiding among them!</i>

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:01.200
<i>This one?!</i>

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:06.710
<i>Damn!</i>

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:07.900
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:09.610
<i>Another one!</i>

00:19:09.610 --> 00:19:12.150
One toy balloon...

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:15.180
Two toy balloons!

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:18.490
Three toy balloons!

00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:24.630
The dozen balloons and rainbow
smoke bombs I reluctantly bought...

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.720
How beautiful they were...

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.470
I knew it was a vicious desert,

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:35.240
but I never thought I'd get my bag stolen.

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:39.570
That's how I felt as I rigged it
with explosives as insurance...

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:43.810
But I never actually
thought I'd blow 'em up...

00:19:43.810 --> 00:19:45.110
<i>Like I care!</i>

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:48.740
<i>Damn! You can't mock me!</i>

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:51.030
You know...

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:54.520
I've made the most of
situations presented to me,

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:57.890
to escape from many hells.

00:19:57.890 --> 00:20:06.060
With skill like that, I would never
lose to a weakling sniper like you!

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.570
<i>Probably just another balloon...</i>

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:21.800
<i>Or the real one...</i>

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:24.960
<i>Master!</i>

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:28.860
Aimed for my rifle, huh?
You think you're so cool...

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:31.590
That's why you're weak.

00:20:31.590 --> 00:20:35.970
If it were me, I would've shot you
through the head without a word!

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:41.130
<i>Master lost!</i>

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:52.950
<i>No! Don't rape me!</i>

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:56.050
<i>Idiot!</i>

00:20:58.550 --> 00:21:03.510
Geez! The only thing worth
anything is this Dragunov?

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:08.360
This ain't worth enough to fix my M40...

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:10.520
I won, but I ain't happy...

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.410
<i>Master!</i>

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:26.750
<i>I beg you!</i>

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:28.610
Quit calling me master!

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:38.360
Following me around ain't gonna make it so!

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:42.630
<i>No! I will follow you everywhere
until you make me your pupil!</i>

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:46.260
I don't like your face.
It reminds me of bad memories.

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:52.770
<i>In this way, the Sunabouzu
found himself the target</i>

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:55.210
<i>of those seeking a name for themselves.</i>

00:21:56.140 --> 00:21:57.580
<i>Oh, dear...</i>

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:11.090
<i>I beg of you! I want to be the
strongest woman in the desert!</i>

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:13.380
You just don't get it...

00:22:13.380 --> 00:22:16.460
<i>I'll do anything you ask of me!</i>

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:18.670
<i>Even if it's something naughty!</i>

00:22:18.670 --> 00:22:22.600
I ain't interested in bony,
flat-chested chicks.

00:22:22.600 --> 00:22:24.470
<i>Then I'll grow giant breasts!</i>

00:22:24.470 --> 00:22:26.740
<i>"Giant Breasts"</i>

00:22:24.470 --> 00:22:26.740
Eh?!

00:23:56.370 --> 00:23:58.310
<i>Yo! Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu here!</i>

00:23:58.310 --> 00:24:01.340
<i>How was this episode's boob lady?
Wait, there was none!</i>

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:04.480
<i>They're just for show!
Important people wouldn't understand!</i>

00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:06.350
<i>More importantly, what about me?</i>

00:24:06.350 --> 00:24:08.350
<i>On the next Sunabouzu -
Well and Trap</i>

00:24:08.350 --> 00:24:10.820
<i>- Huh?
- Miss it and it's flat chests for you!</i>
